      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T20:29:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed OOB, the Type-C spec as of right now says that a non-debug-accessory Source is supposed to just sit in AttachWait.SNK if it detects a DTS Sink. Can you implement that, so we can check if it breaks FAFT or something?",
